    "detailed_description": "AXIAL NULL is a hybrid tactical roguelike, combining both Turn-based and Real-time elements into its core gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action Phase</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072800/extras/6d31c8d81b3fa30d8027b7d93200eb54.avif?t=1723444964\" width=320 height=180 /></span><br>During ACTION PHASE, you are free to consider your options with no time limit. You may do one of the following:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Do Basic Attack With No Cost<br></li><li>Do skills at the cost of your Mental Points (MP)<br></li><li>Use items to aid yourself in combat<br></li><li>Charge to recover more MP</li></ul>After you do one action, BATTLE PHASE will commence.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Phase</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072800/extras/f98d1a818e438708e8decaf1089ba6e8.avif?t=1723444964\" width=320 height=180 /></span><br><br>During BATTLE PHASE, enemies will actively attack you in real-time. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>MOVE in 4 directions (up, down, right, and left) as long as you stay inside unbroken light-colored tiles<br></li><li>Do basic ATTACK by pressing Z key</li></ul>After 10 seconds have passed, ACTION PHASE will commence again, and the cycle continues.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS STORE PAGE IS INCOMPLETE</h2>Currently this store page is filled with placeholder images, which <u>will not represent the final game and are subject to change.</u>",
